The contents of this directory (the miniHawk core package: the managed adapter
in source/, native/bizinterface.cpp, defctrl.json, and the build scripts) are
derived from BizHawk (https://github.com/TASEmulators/BizHawk), original work
by the BizHawk team, and are provided under the MIT License reproduced below,
as required by that license. Subsequent modifications made for quickerNES and
miniHawk are provided under the same MIT License.

Note on combined works: the quickerNES emulator core in this repository is
licensed under the GNU GPL v2 (see the LICENSE file at the repository root).
Binaries produced by compiling native/bizinterface.cpp together with the core
sources (libquicknes.dll / libquicknes.so, including the prebuilt copies in
natives/), and the assembled core package (quickernes.zip), are therefore
distributed under the terms of the GPL v2 as a whole. The MIT license below
applies to the files of this directory as source code.

Bundled data files have their own provenance:
- NesCarts.xml is BootGod's NES Cart Database (http://bootgod.dyndns.org /
  NesDev community), redistributed here as previously shipped with BizHawk.
- palettes/ contains NES palette files by various emulator authors,
  redistributed here as previously shipped with BizHawk.

